      "writtenOn": "2022-11-11T07:50:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I recalled that libselinux was both VNDK and PLATFORM. There were two dumps in vndk/ and platform/. We wanted to diff both of them.\n\nIf I remember correctly,\nthe vndk variant\u0027s useVndk \u003d\u003d true and isVndk \u003d\u003d true\nthe platform variant\u0027s useVndk \u003d\u003d false and isVndk \u003d\u003d true\n, so we cannot remove useVndk.",
